{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a fast-paced, post-apocalyptic zombie shooter with a high level of difficulty, requiring players to focus and flexibly position themselves to shoot and draw their weapons. Every time you eliminate a zombie, there's a chance a random weapon pack will drop. Obtaining this random weapon pack will unlock super weapons to aid in the zombie extermination. Experience the thrill of super weapons and survive until the countdown ends to win!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3959110?t=1755654882","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959110/42e791b2db1f0e0b43626f6717b04aad706f5850/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1755654882","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959110/a18f8ea95ce30d1df1faf962f574d75b1d23d922/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755654882","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959110/a18f8ea95ce30d1df1faf962f574d75b1d23d922/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755654882","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a fast-paced, post-apocalyptic zombie shooter with a high level of difficulty, requiring players to focus and flexibly position themselves to shoot and draw their weapons. Every time you eliminate a zombie, there's a chance a random weapon pack will drop. Obtaining this random weapon pack will unlock super weapons to aid in the zombie extermination. Experience the thrill of super weapons and survive until the countdown ends to win!</p>","developers":["Aeon Ye"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/